\f0\fs24 \cf0 ====Readme file for Mental navigation data======\
contact Sujaya Neupane for questions: sneupane@mit.edu; sujayanyaupane@gmail.com\
\
Trial structure: \
\
BASELINE\cf2 ======\cf0 Fix_on \cf3 \'97 200ms \'97\cf0  Start_landmark_ON (fixation requirement off)\cf3 \'97 400ms \'97\cf0 Target_landmark_ON\cf2 ==400 to1400ms delay==\cf0 go_cue_ON\cf2 ==reaction_time==\cf4 Joystick_onset\cf2 ==650ms to 3200ms mental navigation==\cf4 Joystick_offset\'97reward+visual feedback of current landmark+end trial\cf0 \
\
\
Data structure: neuron x time x trial 	[time: 10 seconds for each trial -500ms to 9500ms from start_landmark onset]\
data variables: \
\
neur_tensor_trialon:  1ms binned firing rate\
lfp_tensor_trialon:     raw LFP sampled at 1khz\
\
trialon: 		binning parameters as follows\
\
\
         bef: 0.5000\
         aft: 9.5000\
    binwidth: .001\
       edges: [1\'d79999 double]\
\
\
trial condition labels in cond_matrix: trial x condition_labels\
12 condition labels: \
\cf4       \{'ta'            \} \'97> true temporal distance between start and target landmark (seconds)\
      \{'tp'            \} \'97> animals\'92 produced temporal distance between start and target landmark (seconds)\
     \{'curr'          \} \'97> start landmark index (1 to 6)\
    \{'target'        \} \'97> target landmark index (1 to 6)\cf5 \
\cf0 \
       \{'rt'            \} \'97> animals\'92 reaction time after the go cue (seconds)\
    \{'delay'         \} \'97> variable delay from target image presentation and go cue (0.4s to 1.4s from an exponential distribution)\
\
   \{'trial_type'    \} \'97> drift and sequence visible (value=1), drift visible but sequence occluded (value=2), fully occluded mental navigation (value=3)\
    \{'seqq'          \} \'97> landmark sequence identity (1,2 or 3): seq1 and seq2: same speed=sp; seq3: slower speed 1.5*sp \
\
     \{'succ'          \} \'97> successful trial (1 or 0) irrespective of # of attempts \
    \{'attempt'       \}\'97> number of attempts to finish a trial(1 or 2)\
\
 \{'numrepeat'     \}\'97> # of times a given landmark pair trial was consecutively repeated \
\{'validtrials_mm\'92\}\'97> valid trial estimated by fitting behavior (tp distribution) to a mixture model with a gaussian distribution and a uniform distribution (for lapse trials)\
\
Matlab code to get mental navigation trials for all the 30 conditions (6 choose 2): \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\fs20 \cf0 load(filename)
\f0\fs24 \

\f1\fs20  \cf6 for\cf0  ii=1:length(cond_label)
\fs24 \

\fs20     eval([\cf7 'params.'\cf0  cond_label\{ii\} \cf7 '=cond_matrix(:,strcmp(cond_label, cond_label\{ii\} ));'\cf0 ]);
\fs24 \

\fs20 \cf6 end\cf0  
\f0\fs24 \

\f1\fs20 trials		 = find(params.trial_type==3 & params.seqq<3 & params.attempt==1);
\fs24 \

\fs20 mental_trials_data = neur_tensor_trialon(:,:,trials);
\fs24 \
